From d2c509614fef53caf23cbebb859d50dd22e69946 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 17:20:50 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 246/410] Unified: one name for one thing, as in the glossary
 of the redesign

Additive loft/pipe/helix/primitive, multi-transform, datum, grounding,
solving, projection group, balloon and the parallel constraint (whose
Japanese was a misspelling) are worded as in the glossary (chapter 8 of
docs/ui-redesign/00-design.md of freecad-ja-unified), as overrides of the
modules' translations (generated by kantan-cad i18n/unify_terms.py).
"Ask AI" is the same everywhere. Translations of the new messages of
this release.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
